    "representation": "pdf-text-entry",
    "text": "Given a set P of odd primes, let CTP (Z) denote the subgroup of CT(Z)\nwhich is generated by all class transpositions which interchange residue classes whose\nmoduli have only prime factors in P ∪ {2}. The groups CTP (Z) are simple (Math.\nZ., 264, no. 4 (2010), 927–938). Are they pairwise nonisomorphic?               S. Kohl",
